WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.210
- "Just landed, LA, like
first stop, In-N-Out,

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.380
Animal Style, crazy time
something wrapped in"...

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.630
Like, I don't know what
any of these things are.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.970
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.380
- It's kind of like the west coast

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.350
staple fast food restaurant, right?

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.270
- I have not had the
secret menu at In-N-Out.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.600
Someone told me about it, it
didn't sound that appealing.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.180
- The secret menu...

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.600
I don't know how secret it is.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.350
(upbeat music)

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.230
- What? (laughs)

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:29.390
- So, there's no bun
with the Flying Dutchman?

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:32.110
- I see nothing Dutch
nor flying about this.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:33.900
- Yeah, I don't think it
looks like a burger at all.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.320
- Looks like a smiley face.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.151
- Yeah, it's like a grilled
cheese made of meat.

00:00:38.151 --> 00:00:39.240
- Mmm...

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.740
- It is just like an
incomplete experience.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.040
- You're supposed to have a bun and stuff.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.210
- I might order it with a salad.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.750
Do they have salads there?

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.420
(upbeat music)

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:55.340
- Oh, it's lettuce.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.720
- I feel like the point of a bun

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.680
is to sort of hold everything together,

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.770
and I'm not sure this
lettuce is doing a good job.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.600
- You would think Protein Style would mean

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.400
more protein, maybe?

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.610
Like chicken breasts as the bun.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:10.480
- It's like a giant
salad that you can hold

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.610
and it's filled with meat.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.921
That sounds good.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.020
- I feel like anything tastes good

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:19.410
if you put enough Thousand
Island dressing on it.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.120
- This is good, I like this.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.280
I would go for this.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:23.870
I'm gonna eat more.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:26.500
(upbeat music)

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.920
- Okay, I feel like this is
the one that I've heard about.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.340
- I don't know what that...

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.210
What it means.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:35.263
- This one has a bun,
which is comforting to me.

00:01:35.263 --> 00:01:36.010
- No, I don't...

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.300
I still don't know what it means. (laughs)

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.350
- Honestly, it doesn't
taste that different to me.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.100
Tastes pretty regular, guys.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.680
(upbeat music)

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.440
- It's not like meat style.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.048
It's not covered in animal.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.190
- It's like a salty, cheesy good time.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:54.360
- Mhmmm, okay, I like
it, mhmmm, I like this.

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.410
(upbeat music)

00:01:57.410 --> 00:02:00.410
- This has got to be a joke

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:04.444
because this is just a burger
without a patty, right?

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:05.870
- So, there's...

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.920
It doesn't look bad,

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.620
it just doesn't look
like a grilled cheese.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.460
- I feel

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:12.800
like you could do a way better job

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.130
making a grilled cheese at your house.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.170
- It just makes me feel sad.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:16.346
It's like they forgot the burger.

00:02:16.346 --> 00:02:18.436
- I don't know.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:22.720
Alright, it's also good.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.720
(upbeat music)

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:27.650
- Ooh, love dessert.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.770
- Oh, ho, ho, ho.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:31.820
- I hate cold things.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:32.940
(laughs)

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.440
- This is, again, really just like...

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.570
It's not so secret,

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:37.280
it's more of just like
a thing of convenience.

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.990
Just put all three kinds in one cup.

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.820
There you go, secret menu.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.830
(upbeat music)

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:43.950
- I don't know.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:45.950
- It's a charming little menu.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.830
- You liked it so far this way,

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.630
here's more stuff on top of it.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.830
- The secret seems to be that
they thought of all this stuff

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:56.010
and it's not good enough
to be on the real menu,

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.470
so it's just like, there's a secret menu.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:02.279
- The Secret is a book that Oprah found

00:03:02.279 --> 00:03:04.220
and she became obsessed with it

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.430
and told everybody it
would change their lives.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:10.194
Or it's just probably a lot more sauce.

